# Audit R3: without this file `COPY . .` baked local runtime state into the image —
# data/profiles.json (account passwords and TOTP seeds in `plain` mode), profile
# cookie/session files, plus the whole .git history. Per dockerignore(5) matched
# paths are removed from the build context and therefore never reach an image layer
# created by COPY/ADD.
#
# Runtime state arrives through the bind mount (docker-compose.yml: ./data:/app/data),
# so excluding it from the image is safe; the app recreates data/ on first start.
data/
.git/
.github/

# Secrets and local artefacts
.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.nazak
*.bak
*.log

# Python noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage*
pytest-cache-files-*/

# PyInstaller / Inno Setup output
build/
dist/
dist_installer/
*.spec
*.zip

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
